{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"pro-可表函子"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"pro-可表函子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 到 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 的 <strong>pro-可表函子</strong>是 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Set})^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 中"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":"的余滤极限, 对应 $\\mathcal C$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>当然, pro-可表函子 $\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 也是 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathsf{Set})$ 中"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}